<title>UK: Veteran Parkinson named head of Conservative party.</title>
<headline>Veteran Parkinson named head of Conservative party.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Veteran politician Cecil Parkinson was named chairman of Britain's opposition Conservative party on Friday. The announcement was made by new party leader William Hague.</p>
